    "description": "Naked Pea has one ingredient, protein from yellow split peas grown in the US and Canada, extracted with water rather than chemical solvents, per the brand. A two-scoop serving gives 27 g of protein and about 120 calories. Naked says it is NSF Contents Certified and independently tested for heavy metals. In the 5 lb bag at list price it costs well under a dollar per 25 g of protein, the cheapest in the range.",
